    {
      "id": "p0052-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Following Undertale's official Japanese release in 2017, its recognition skyrocketed. The response to the game closely mirrored that of the English version's debut, and it achieved success in almost every way.",
        "raw": "Following Underta/e's official Japanese release in 2017, its recognition\nskyrocketed. The response to the game closely mirrored that of the English\nversion's debut, and it achieved success in almost every way.",
