      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although Undertale was originally only available to purchase as a digital download, it consistently sold well in Japan. Almost immediately, it topped digital sales charts and even broke into the standard sales charts.",
        "raw": "Although Undertale was originally only available to purchase as a digital\ndownload, it consistently sold well in Japan. Almost immediately, it topped\ndigital sales charts and even broke into the standard sales charts.",
