      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale was a hit among Japanese players as well. The game received recognition at small fan events, at major professional events, on national television, and more. Rival magazines competed to interview Toby for exclusive articles. Japanese fans showered Toby with drawings, videos, and thank-you messages.",
