      "source": {
        "text": "Lastly, the response to Undertale's Japanese release brought Toby sig11ificant professional success. Suddenly, Undertale characters and music began to make cameos in colossal hits like the Super Smash Bros. and Taiko Drum Master series. Legendary game creators met with Toby to inquire about collaborative projects. Toby was even invited to compose music for a new Pokemon game.",
